    help_intro: 'Short answers for everyday use. Tap a question.',
    faq_1_q: 'How do I clock in?',
    faq_1_a: 'Scan the QR code at the kiosk with your paired phone. The first scan clocks in, the next one out. It is fastest with the installed app: tap “Scan QR code”.',
    faq_2_q: 'The camera does not work',
    faq_2_a: 'Allow the browser or the app to use the camera (your phone’s settings). The camera only works over https. Alternatively scan the QR code with the phone’s normal camera app and open the link.',
    faq_3_q: 'How do I pair a phone, and what if it is lost?',
    faq_3_a: 'On the computer: Devices → “Create QR code”, then scan it with the phone and confirm. If the phone is lost, revoke it under Devices. It can no longer clock in after that.',
    faq_4_q: 'How do I take a break?',
    faq_4_a: 'In Settings choose the mode “With breaks”: then there are buttons for break and resume. In mode “Simple” the break results from the gap between clocking out and in again.',
    faq_5_q: 'I forgot to clock out',
    faq_5_a: 'No worries: end the block under “Today” and file a request under “Corrections” with the right time. Your manager approves it and the change is logged.',
    faq_6_q: 'Who sees my data?',
    faq_6_a: 'You and your managers. Colleagues do not see your times. Nextcloud administrators only see times if they are also a manager. Details are below under Privacy.',
    faq_7_q: 'What does the time account mean?',
    faq_7_a: 'It counts overtime (plus) and time owed (minus): time worked plus vacation and sick leave, minus target. Public holidays lower the target.',
    faq_8_q: 'How do I install the app?',
    faq_8_a: 'On Android and on a computer in Chrome or Edge: the “Install as an app” button on the home page or under Devices. On iPhone in Safari: Share → “Add to Home Screen”. On iPhone, pair again inside the app afterwards.',
    faq_9_q: 'Why do I see no configuration and no team?',
    faq_9_a: 'These areas are for managers only. A Nextcloud administrator decides who is a manager through the managers group.',
    help_priv_t: 'Privacy in short',
    help_priv_p: 'The app stores only what time tracking requires:',
    help_priv_1: 'Start, end and breaks of your working time as well as requests and their change log.',
    help_priv_2: 'Your paired phone can only clock in and out, nothing more. You can revoke it at any time under Devices.',
    help_priv_3: 'Data is deleted after the configured retention period. Under Settings you can export all your data.',
    help_more_t: 'More'
